":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Tl1Y_-KvMb1m0W_9m-EFjw","review_id":"xhZ1Tboa_IuWrWJYMhX4pg","date":"2012-02-26T03:00:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.921707272529602,"text_excerpt":"It's a small Rouses, but since we only have 2 on the westbank, I tend to go here every once in a while. They have a decent produce section, deli, seafood, meat, bakery, and a surprisingly large selection of alcohol. Everything that I need is usually in-stock. There isn't a whole lot of traffic in this area, so the checkout lines are never long. It's a very quick and easy \"in and out\" trip to the grocery store."},{"business_id":"Tl1Y_-KvMb1m0W_9m-EFjw","review_id":"4yxKJZKOvFCqFMDGMtROig","date":"2015-08-31T14:54:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9174702167510986,"text_excerpt":"By far my favorite rouses on the westbank. This store carries a great selection of local and healthy options. The store has a dedicated \"health food\" section, but also a lot of organic and other healthy choices integrated into the general store. Though a small grocery physically, its packed with all the great specialty sections you come to expect from rouses, including the deli, butcher, and great beer selection"},{"business_id":"Tl1Y_-KvMb1m0W_9m-EFjw","review_id":"_Nd2pu3HBK8AWX5npA_1eA","date":"2014-06-24T07:07:33","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9106438159942627,"text_excerpt":"Best neighborhood grocery store with competitive prices and fresh produce/meat. I also love the huge variety of wines/liquor. I love that there are items here that you wouldn't find in a walmart for example. The sushi is pretty darn good when you're having a sushi craving but don't wanna drive out of your way to get some. The associates are always nice and looking to help and the cashiers always seem happy which is always a good thing."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Tl1Y_-KvMb1m0W_9m-EFjw","photo_id":"mavfOC00EkbMwmvYEWl5Gw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/mavfOC00EkbMwmvYEWl5Gw.jpg","visual_representativeness":1.0}]},"notebook_case":null}
